    {
      "extraction_class": "Procedure",
      "extraction_text": "4. Coeficiente de aislamiento del revestimiento (d/λp) is obtained as the average of the faces exposed to fire, where d is the thickness of the coating [m] and λp is the effective thermal conductivity of the coating [W/mK] for the total fire resistance time considered. For stony, ceramic, concrete, mortar, and plaster materials, the λp value corresponding to 20 ºC can be used.",
      "attributes": {
